        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Moe Greene, Moe Dalitz\n- Works: The Godfather\n- Topics: Fictional characters, organized crime\n\nFacts:\n- Moe Dalitz was the nickname of Morris Barney Dalitz, who was born on December 25, 1899, and died on August 31, 1989.\n- Moe Dalitz was an American gangster, businessman, casino owner, and philanthropist.\n- Moe Greene is a fictional character who appears in Mario Puzo's 1969 novel The Godfather.\n- Moe Greene also appears in the 1972 film adaptation of The Godfather.",
